3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQhPfxG2VX7QtfZ2licgnRLlqISTcKcpO1cABR9EB9lWw&oe=6B0C600F"}, "display_name": "VENTA X", "keywords": ["VR", "POP", "3D", "Concert", "Music"], "long_description": "VENTA X is an app that boasts the largest collection of K-POP 3D VR videos worldwide, allowing you to easily and diversely enjoy high-quality 3D VR videos of K-POP artists, including music broadcasts and concerts.\n\nFans from 60 countries around the globe are meeting K-POP artists through VENTA X's immersive 8K 3D VR content, as if they are right in front of their eyes.\n\nDiscover the latest 8K 3D VR content of K-POP artists, updated weekly!\n\n[VENTA X Original content: 8K 3D VR MUSIC CINEMA]\n\u00b7 A performance that unfolds the artist's songs with movie-like stories.\n\u00b7 VR-optimized performances and immersive CG.\n\n[VENTA X K-POP Series content: 8K 3D VR performance VOD]\n\u00b7 Experience the diverse aspects of K-POP artists, including performances and variety shows, in a three-dimensional VR content.", "short_description": "Enjoy K-POP content produced in immersive 8K 3D VR! You can watch for extended periods without experiencing motion sickness, and the content is shot from an eye-level perspective, allowing you to have an experience of making eye contact with K-POP artists. There's a plethora of content available for you to enjoy!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "00_Logo(Transparent).png", "id": "1444402182919663", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003255_1444402186252996_7014711383928885591_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BK3BTHWH88IQ7kNvwGjc1f5&_nc_oc=AdrHJxLAu0Q1M3dXT7t5sxfSOeae9hSQbipEy2y8P6e9SG4ozZGcj46z7Nshf6eKWMs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTCXDiKCyTr10mHEDaKagGcI7UF8l3JSihg2bkH-0dXFQ&oe=6B0C751D"}, {"file_name": "03_portrait.png", "id": "1171362250588035", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTR